DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260827T223000
SUMMARY:Chicago College Tour — Itinerary (The Study at UChicago)
DESCRIPTION:Thursday: ORD arrival, check in at The Study, UChicago quad/57th Street orientation walk, and dinner. Friday: UChicago visit, direct rideshare with luggage to Northwestern, Northwestern tour, then ORD. Full itinerary: https://github.com/gryffindorhammer/family-tools/blob/main/travel/2026-08-chicago-college-tour-itinerary.md
LOCATION:The Study at University of Chicago, 1227 E 60th St, Chicago, IL 60637
URL:https://github.com/gryffindorhammer/family-tools/blob/main/travel/2026-08-chicago-college-tour-itinerary.md
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
